This is a self-contained HTML file that recreates the classic 1978 Space Invaders arcade experience. It includes the original sprite designs, rules, and mechanics in a single file.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Space Invaders · 1978 Taito Cabinet</title>
  <style>
    /* === CRT + cabinet styling === */
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .cabinet {
      background: #0b0b1a;
      border-radius: 28px 28px 12px 12px;
